{"4978010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Everybody Loves a Good Hole","steam_appid":4978010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5195860],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody Loves a Good Hole is a short, satisfying incremental about steering a black hole and swallowing everything in sight. Devour colorful cubes for XP and coins, grow bigger, and pour it all into a deep upgrade tree. Bigger cubes, wilder chaos, just one more run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a black hole with your mouse. Pull in hundreds of colorful cubes. Grow. Repeat — but bigger every time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swallow everything<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your black hole across a bright, chaotic world packed with colorful cubes. Small ones vanish instantly; bigger ones take patience, upgrades, or the right power. The bigger you grow, the more you devour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn cubes into power<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cube pays out twice: XP to grow your hole mid-run, and coins to keep and spend between runs. Runs are timed, so every second counts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig into a deep upgrade tree<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins on permanent upgrades — longer runs, wider pull, richer cubes, bigger starting size — and unlock entirely new cube types worth far more than the last.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash magic-book powers<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb magic books mid-run to trigger temporary skills like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet. Level them up in the tree, chain them together, and watch the screen erupt into buttery-smooth chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just one more run<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, snappy runs and that itch to go again. Chase milestones, unlock the next power, beat your last haul.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕳️ <strong>Steer &amp; swallow<\/strong> — mouse-driven black hole gameplay, easy to learn in seconds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Deep upgrade tree<\/strong> — permanent upgrades across multiple branches<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 <strong>Magic-book skills<\/strong> — unleash and level up powers like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Colorful, chaotic world<\/strong> — hundreds of cubes on screen at once<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧊 <strong>Escalating cube types<\/strong> — unlock bigger cubes worth more XP and coins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Short &amp; satisfying<\/strong> — quick runs, pure dopamine, no filler<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Fully localized<\/strong> — playable in 15 languages<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody Loves a Good Hole is a short, satisfying incremental about steering a black hole and swallowing everything in sight. Devour colorful cubes for XP and coins, grow bigger, and pour it all into a deep upgrade tree. Bigger cubes, wilder chaos, just one more run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a black hole with your mouse. Pull in hundreds of colorful cubes. Grow. Repeat — but bigger every time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swallow everything<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your black hole across a bright, chaotic world packed with colorful cubes. Small ones vanish instantly; bigger ones take patience, upgrades, or the right power. The bigger you grow, the more you devour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn cubes into power<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cube pays out twice: XP to grow your hole mid-run, and coins to keep and spend between runs. Runs are timed, so every second counts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig into a deep upgrade tree<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins on permanent upgrades — longer runs, wider pull, richer cubes, bigger starting size — and unlock entirely new cube types worth far more than the last.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.mp4?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash magic-book powers<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb magic books mid-run to trigger temporary skills like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet. Level them up in the tree, chain them together, and watch the screen erupt into buttery-smooth chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.poster.avif?t=1793710881\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/extras\/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.webm?t=1793710881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just one more run<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, snappy runs and that itch to go again. Chase milestones, unlock the next power, beat your last haul.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕳️ <strong>Steer &amp; swallow<\/strong> — mouse-driven black hole gameplay, easy to learn in seconds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Deep upgrade tree<\/strong> — permanent upgrades across multiple branches<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 <strong>Magic-book skills<\/strong> — unleash and level up powers like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Colorful, chaotic world<\/strong> — hundreds of cubes on screen at once<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧊 <strong>Escalating cube types<\/strong> — unlock bigger cubes worth more XP and coins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Short &amp; satisfying<\/strong> — quick runs, pure dopamine, no filler<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Fully localized<\/strong> — playable in 15 languages<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Everybody Loves a Good Hole is a short, satisfying incremental about steering a black hole and swallowing everything in sight. Devour colorful cubes for XP and coins, grow bigger, and pour it all into a deep upgrade tree. Bigger cubes, wilder chaos, just one more run.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/bb5304ae12bf4818b055fc168fcdfbb0964f786c\/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793710881","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/1368a1ce85329d7eeb2b079feb43dfdb2879f23d\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793710881","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4978010\/1368a1ce85329d7eeb2b079feb43dfdb2879f23d\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793710881","website":"https:\/\/roovelstudio.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Roovel Studio"],"publishers":["Roovel Studio"],"demos":[{"appid":5195860,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":399,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$3.99"},"packages":[1727213],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Everybody Loves a Good Hole","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false",